# Pull requests

## Before opening

- Branch from `main` in a worktree (see `git-branches-worktrees.mdc`)
- Run CI gate locally
- Push feature branch only — never `main`

## gh pr create

Include **Summary** and **Test plan**. Title can be normal prose (squash commit uses PR title unless overridden).

Apply labels via `gh pr edit`:

- Exactly one `type:` (`type:feat`, `type:bug`, `type:refactor`, `type:security`, `type:docs`)
- One or more `system:` when applicable (`system:ai`, `system:aviation`, `system:ping`, `system:tracker`, `system:schedule`, `system:irc`, `system:config`)
- `type:security` supersedes `type:bug`

Full label tables: [CONTRIBUTING.md](../CONTRIBUTING.md).

## Merge

Wait for all required status checks green (see CLAUDE.md § CI). Rebase on `main` if strict blocks merge. Merge with squash: `gh pr merge --squash`.
